# Files GitHub Pages publishes. Nothing else in this repo is served.
# One path per line, relative to the repo root. A line with * is a glob that
# stays inside its folder (it never crosses a /) and must match at least one
# file. A missing path, an empty glob, or a path outside the repo fails the
# deploy, and the live site stays as it was. Add a line only for a file the
# page itself loads; never notes, tools, protocols or config.
index.html
robots.txt
data/index.json
data/history.json
data/panels/*.json
